            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mu nsambo eyo, Aaroni aidha kubanga n'amaina ag'abaana ba Yakobo ku kivaalo kye eky'omu kifuba, mwene ng'Omukulu wa Bakabona ky'anaakozesanga okumanha Katonda ky'ayenda buli lw'anaajanga mu Kifo Ekitukuvu mu maiso ga Katonda kibe eky'okwidhusa eri Abaisiraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 28:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era mu kivaalo ekyo eky'omu kifuba, Omukulu wa Bakabona ky'anaakozesanga okumanha nze Musengwa Katonda kye nhenda, oidha kutaamu ebintu eby'okukozesebwanga kabona oyo okumanha kye nhenda ebyetebwa Urimu ni Thummimu, bibenga mu kifuba kye ng'ali kwidha mu maiso gange. Mu nsambo eyo Aaroni, aidha kubanga n'obusobozi mu kifuba kye obw'okumanhanga kye nhenda Abaisiraeli bakole.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.28.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.28.30"
            ]
          }
        },
